---
description: Push and deploy after completing code changes
alwaysApply: true
---

After finishing any task that modifies the who-am-i codebase:

1. Run `npm run ship -- "<short commit message>"` to commit and push to `master`.
2. Do not skip push/deploy unless the user explicitly says not to.
3. Exclude the `who-am-i/` prototype folder from commits (ship script handles this).
4. If GitHub Actions PartyKit deploy fails, remind the user to add `PARTYKIT_LOGIN` and `PARTYKIT_TOKEN` secrets (run `npx partykit token generate` locally once).
5. Vercel deploys automatically when the repo is linked in Vercel Dashboard; otherwise run `npx vercel deploy --prod --yes`.
